						<div class="mnotice" ><div class="tab_on" id="notice201"><a href="#notice201" onkeypress="" onclick="onNoticeShowAuto(2,1);return false;" class="dpb" title="공지사항 탭 보기">Academic FAQs</a><div class="tabcontent" id="notice201_menu" style="visibility:visible;"><ul><li><div class="txt-wrap"><p class="subject"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186">Can I apply for a new student card if I lose m..</a></p><p class="desc">Yes, you may pick up your new card two weeks after submitting an application electronically via the Integrated Portal System (http://yes.knu.ac.kr). The application can be completed at any time. Please remember to upload a photo when you submit your ..</p><p class="date"><SPAN>2021.07</SPAN>27</p><div class="txt-more"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186&mode=view&mv_data=aWR4PTQ0JnN0YXJ0UGFnZT0mbGlzdE5vPSZ0YWJsZT1leF9iYnNfZGF0YV9ncmFkZW4mY29kZT1MYVY3Sjh1bmJDV2cmc2VhcmNoX2l0ZW09JnNlYXJjaF9vcmRlcj0mb3JkZXJfbGlzdD0mbGlzdF9zY2FsZT0mdmlld19sZXZlbD0mdmlld19jYXRlPSZ2aWV3X2NhdGUyPSZzaXRlX2NvZGU9Z3JhZGVu">+</a></div></div></li><li><div class="txt-wrap"><p class="subject"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186">Can graduate students get a long-term parking ..</a></p><p class="desc">If your car is registered in your or your spouse's name, please submit copies of the car's registration license and your family register (if the car is registered under your spouse's name) to the General Affairs Team and submit the application form f..</p><p class="date"><SPAN>2021.07</SPAN>27</p><div class="txt-more"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186&mode=view&mv_data=aWR4PTQzJnN0YXJ0UGFnZT0mbGlzdE5vPSZ0YWJsZT1leF9iYnNfZGF0YV9ncmFkZW4mY29kZT1MYVY3Sjh1bmJDV2cmc2VhcmNoX2l0ZW09JnNlYXJjaF9vcmRlcj0mb3JkZXJfbGlzdD0mbGlzdF9zY2FsZT0mdmlld19sZXZlbD0mdmlld19jYXRlPSZ2aWV3X2NhdGUyPSZzaXRlX2NvZGU9Z3JhZGVu">+</a></div></div></li><li><div class="txt-wrap"><p class="subject"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186">How can I request copies of official documents..</a></p><p class="desc">In-person: Documents can be requested at the Academic Affairs Department or by using the vending machines located on the first floor of the Student Services Center.You may also request documents by fax, mail, or over the internet. Check the KNU web s..</p><p class="date"><SPAN>2021.07</SPAN>27</p><div class="txt-more"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186&mode=view&mv_data=aWR4PTQyJnN0YXJ0UGFnZT0mbGlzdE5vPSZ0YWJsZT1leF9iYnNfZGF0YV9ncmFkZW4mY29kZT1MYVY3Sjh1bmJDV2cmc2VhcmNoX2l0ZW09JnNlYXJjaF9vcmRlcj0mb3JkZXJfbGlzdD0mbGlzdF9zY2FsZT0mdmlld19sZXZlbD0mdmlld19jYXRlPSZ2aWV3X2NhdGUyPSZzaXRlX2NvZGU9Z3JhZGVu">+</a></div></div></li><li><div class="txt-wrap"><p class="subject"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186">How much is the tuition for students who have ..</a></p><p class="desc">It is 10% of the regular student development fee.</p><p class="date"><SPAN>2021.07</SPAN>27</p><div class="txt-more"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186&mode=view&mv_data=aWR4PTQxJnN0YXJ0UGFnZT0mbGlzdE5vPSZ0YWJsZT1leF9iYnNfZGF0YV9ncmFkZW4mY29kZT1MYVY3Sjh1bmJDV2cmc2VhcmNoX2l0ZW09JnNlYXJjaF9vcmRlcj0mb3JkZXJfbGlzdD0mbGlzdF9zY2FsZT0mdmlld19sZXZlbD0mdmlld19jYXRlPSZ2aWV3X2NhdGUyPSZzaXRlX2NvZGU9Z3JhZGVu">+</a></div></div></li><li><div class="txt-wrap"><p class="subject"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186">Can students who have completed their coursewo..</a></p><p class="desc">As refunds are impossible for those who have already completed their coursework, please consider your decision carefully before registering.</p><p class="date"><SPAN>2021.07</SPAN>27</p><div class="txt-more"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186&mode=view&mv_data=aWR4PTQwJnN0YXJ0UGFnZT0mbGlzdE5vPSZ0YWJsZT1leF9iYnNfZGF0YV9ncmFkZW4mY29kZT1MYVY3Sjh1bmJDV2cmc2VhcmNoX2l0ZW09JnNlYXJjaF9vcmRlcj0mb3JkZXJfbGlzdD0mbGlzdF9zY2FsZT0mdmlld19sZXZlbD0mdmlld19jYXRlPSZ2aWV3X2NhdGUyPSZzaXRlX2NvZGU9Z3JhZGVu">+</a></div></div></li><li><div class="txt-wrap"><p class="subject"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186">How do students who have completed their cours..</a></p><p class="desc">Students who have completed their coursework requirements should submit registration forms to their departments in the middle of February and August and pay their tuition by printing out the tuition bills from the university web site.</p><p class="date"><SPAN>2021.07</SPAN>27</p><div class="txt-more"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186&mode=view&mv_data=aWR4PTM5JnN0YXJ0UGFnZT0mbGlzdE5vPSZ0YWJsZT1leF9iYnNfZGF0YV9ncmFkZW4mY29kZT1MYVY3Sjh1bmJDV2cmc2VhcmNoX2l0ZW09JnNlYXJjaF9vcmRlcj0mb3JkZXJfbGlzdD0mbGlzdF9zY2FsZT0mdmlld19sZXZlbD0mdmlld19jYXRlPSZ2aWV3X2NhdGUyPSZzaXRlX2NvZGU9Z3JhZGVu">+</a></div></div></li></ul></div><div id="notice201_add" class="more" style="visibility:visible;"><a href="./sub.htm?nav_code=gra1626850186" title="공지사항 더보기">+<span></span></a></div></div></div>					</div>
